---
/**
 * 404 (object cutover) — delegates to the shared PageObjectRenderer, which
 * loads the published page_404 object and renders its `cta_banner` section.
 * Astro treats a file at this exact path as the error-page handler regardless
 * of its content, so it stays a thin loader like every other object-backed
 * route. Built entirely from existing, registered component types — no
 * bespoke page section (docs/cms-architecture/design-principles.md).
 */
import PageObjectRenderer from '~/components/cms/PageObjectRenderer.astro';
---

<PageObjectRenderer objectId="page_404" />
